 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Sorry to hear that. You can't change it now, so focus on being supportive from the audience. Find out if there's a live stream, and consider following along on social if time allows. Not usually, no. Sit somewhere you can see and hear without blocking someone. Keep your phone away until the ceremony ends. Only if you know them well enough to say something that actually helps. A short message saying you' leaving right after is better. Hanger together and walk in suits if you have few hours. Ask at the venue if there's any space. You've got this. Be there for the couple, and try to enjoy the atmosphere if you can. They'll appreciate your support no matter how late you get there.",
